# Logs
logs/

# Tool output & planning docs (not tracked).
# `/docs/*` (not `/docs`) because git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded — the architecture docs are linked from CLAUDE.md and
# must ship with the repo, everything else in docs/ is tool output.
/docs/*
!/docs/architecture/
!/docs/adr/
/.review-loop
/.dev-loop
*_FUTURE_IDEAS.md
